{"parse":{"title":"Cloudveiled Ridges in Floral Mists","pageid":430080,"revid":2049099,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Cloudveiled Ridges in Floral Mists</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/4/4c/Constellation_Cloudveiled_Ridges_in_Floral_Mists.png/revision/latest?cb=20260114205514\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Constellation Cloudveiled Ridges in Floral Mists\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/4/4c/Constellation_Cloudveiled_Ridges_in_Floral_Mists.png/revision/latest?cb=20260114205514\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/4/4c/Constellation_Cloudveiled_Ridges_in_Floral_Mists.png/revision/latest?cb=20260114205514 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/4/4c/Constellation_Cloudveiled_Ridges_in_Floral_Mists.png/revision/latest?cb=20260114205514 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Constellation Cloudveiled Ridges in Floral Mists\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Constellation_Cloudveiled_Ridges_in_Floral_Mists.png\" data-image-name=\"Constellation Cloudveiled Ridges in Floral Mists.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Columbina\" title=\"Columbina\">Columbina</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"level\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">4</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Next</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dreamlike_Glow_Across_Tranquil_Waters\" title=\"Dreamlike Glow Across Tranquil Waters\">Dreamlike Glow Across Tranquil Waters</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/Silence_Tending_One_Lone_Song\" title=\"Silence Tending One Lone Song\">Silence Tending One Lone Song</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDescription\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">When <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\"><b>Gravity Interference</b></span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Gravity Ripple</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">After unleashing Elemental Skill Eternal Tides, Columbina will summon Gravity Ripple.<br />Gravity Ripple will follow the current active character on the field, while continuously dealing <span class=\"text-hydro\"><b>AoE Hydro DMG</b></span> to surrounding opponents.<br /><br />Additionally, while Gravity Ripple is on the field, and nearby party members trigger Lunar reactions or inflict Lunar Reaction DMG, Columbina will gain the New Moon's Omen effect for 2s, continuously accumulating Gravity. 20 Gravity can be accumulated every 2s.<br />You can have up to 60 Gravity, and it will be removed when the duration of Gravity Ripple ends.<br />Once Gravity is accumulated to its limit, a special Gravity Interference will be triggered. Different effects will be triggered depending on the Lunar reaction type that has accumulated the most Gravity for Columbina. If the Lunar reaction type that has accumulated the most <b>Gravity</b> for Columbina is:<br /><ul><ul><li> Lunar-Charged: Gravity Interference will deal a single instance of <span class=\"text-electro\"><b>Electro AoE DMG</b></span>. This DMG is considered Lunar-Charged DMG. </li><li> Lunar-Bloom: Gravity Interference will fire 5 Moondew Sigils at surrounding opponents, dealing <span class=\"text-dendro\"><b>Dendro DMG</b></span>. This DMG is considered Lunar-Bloom DMG.</li><li> Lunar-Crystallize: Gravity Interference will deal a single instance of <span class=\"text-geo\"><b>Geo AoE DMG</b></span>. This DMG is considered Lunar-Crystallize DMG.</li></ul></ul></span></span></span> is triggered, 4 Elemental <a href=\"/wiki/Energy\" title=\"Energy\">Energy</a> will be restored to Columbina;<br />Additionally, if the Lunar reaction type that accumulates the most Gravity for Columbina is Lunar-Charged, Lunar-Bloom, or Lunar-Crystallize, the Lunar Reaction DMG dealt by this instance of Gravity Interference is increased by 12.5%/2.5%/12.5% of Columbina's Max <a href=\"/wiki/HP\" title=\"HP\">HP</a> respectively. This effect can be triggered at most once every 15s.<br /><br />All nearby <a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">party</a> members' Lunar Reaction DMG is <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\"><b>elevated</b></span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Elevation</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">Special DMG Boost effect. It is calculated independently of other DMG Boost effects.</span></span></span> by 1.5%.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"scale_att1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Scaling</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Max_HP\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Max HP\">Max HP</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Generation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Energy Generation\">Energy Generation</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar-Charged_DMG_Elevation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lunar-Charged DMG Elevation\">Lunar-Charged DMG Elevation</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar-Bloom_DMG_Elevation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lunar-Bloom DMG Elevation\">Lunar-Bloom DMG Elevation</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar-Crystallize_DMG_Elevation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lunar-Crystallize DMG Elevation\">Lunar-Crystallize DMG Elevation</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/DMG_Elevation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DMG Elevation\">DMG Elevation</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Cloudveiled Ridges in Floral Mists</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Columbina\" title=\"Columbina\">Columbina</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Level_4_Constellation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Level 4 Constellation\">Level 4 Constellation</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FCloudveiled_Ridges_in_Floral_Mists%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>Cloudveiled Ridges in Floral Mists</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">花岚云翳，山岩树影</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Huālán Yúnyì, Shānyán Shùyǐng</span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Floral Mists and Cloud Veils, Mountain Rocks and Tree Shadows</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chines